## Highest Scoring Allocation Candidates

{chr(10).join(f"- `{item['id']}` [{item['score']}] {item['title']} ({item['kind']})" for item in candidates[:12]) if candidates else "- No candidates found."}

## Blocked / Waiting Items

{chr(10).join(f"- `{task['id']}` {task['task']} ({task['status']})" for task in blocked[:12]) if blocked else "- No blocked or waiting items."}

